eative mini-games that test your attention and wit. Each puzzle brings you closer to the heart of the story and the spirit of Christmas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 Embark on a dazzling holiday adventure where wishes can change reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 Explore snowy kingdoms, glittering castles, and enchanted skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 Solve dozens of magical puzzles and clever mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 Search for hidden objects and discover collectible treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 Restore the shattered Christmas Star to open the gateway between worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 Earn achievements as Alex and Henry uncover the true meaning of friendship and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.poster.avif?t=1762341986\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.webm?t=1762341986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118790/extras/1cffcaa52d7546210b61e81128f1b4dd.mp4?t=1762341986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find magic, mystery, and warmth in a holiday journey that will rekindle your sense of wonder and make you believe in Christmas miracles once more.</p>","developers":["Do Games Limited"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Cas